+### Switch M02 packed-instruction coverage (2026-11-08)
+
+Synthetic CPU validation exposed inherited lane/operand-selection defects in
+several packed helper/generator paths. The maintained root overlay records the
+corrections and independent scalar tests. A metadata-only scan of the supported
+SLUS-21590 private generation found zero calls to the affected named packed
+helpers (PMFHL, PINTH/PINTEH, PEXEH/PEXEW/PROT3W and variable word shifts).
+This is compile-output coverage, not a claim about every guest instruction
+that a future dynamically reached program could execute. No new game address
+or gameplay conclusion is established.
